{"seq":2,"slug":"project-delivery-methods","title":"项目交付模式（DBB·设计建造·IPD·CMAR）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/construction-project-management/fundamentals-delivery/project-delivery-methods","wordCount":2191,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"项目交付模式-dbb-设计建造-ipd-cmar\">项目交付模式（DBB·设计建造·IPD·CMAR）</h1><p>业主在工程开工前要做的第一个结构性决策，不是选承包商，而是选「谁和谁签合同、谁承担超支风险、设计与施工在时间轴上如何咬合」——这就是项目交付模式（Project Delivery Method）。同一座医院、同样的图纸，用传统的设计-招标-建造去做，和用集成交付去做，工期和总成本可能相差两位数百分比。据 Procore 的行业测算，选错交付模式会让商业开发项目损失总造价的 8%–15%（<a href=\"https://www.procore.com/library/construction-project-delivery-methods\">Procore, 2026</a>）。本篇把四种主流模式——DBB、设计建造（Design-Build）、CMAR、IPD——放在同一坐标系下拆解，并对照国内工程总承包（EPC）的语境。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-合同关系决定一切\">核心概念：合同关系决定一切</h2><p>交付模式的本质差异，在于合同的拓扑结构：业主与设计方、施工方之间是「分立两份合同」「合并一份合同」还是「三方共担一份合同」。这条主线决定了风险归属、沟通路径和重叠施工（fast-track）的可能性。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[业主选择交付模式] --&gt; B{设计与施工&lt;br/&gt;合同是否分离}&#10;  B --&gt;|分离 + 顺序| C[DBB 设计-招标-建造&lt;br/&gt;设计100%完成再招标]&#10;  B --&gt;|分离 + 早期介入| D[CMAR 风险型施工经理&lt;br/&gt;设计期即定 GMP]&#10;  B --&gt;|合并为单一合同| E[设计建造 Design-Build&lt;br/&gt;单一责任主体]&#10;  B --&gt;|三方共担一份合同| F[IPD 集成项目交付&lt;br/&gt;风险/收益共享池]&#10;  E --&gt; G[国内对应 EPC 工程总承包]&#10;  C --&gt; H[低协同 高确定性]&#10;  D --&gt; I[中协同 GMP 兜底]&#10;  E --&gt; J[高协同 工期压缩]&#10;  F --&gt; K[最高协同 共担成败]\">graph TD\n  A[业主选择交付模式] --&gt; B{设计与施工&lt;br/&gt;合同是否分离}\n  B --&gt;|分离 + 顺序| C[DBB 设计-招标-建造&lt;br/&gt;设计100%完成再招标]\n  B --&gt;|分离 + 早期介入| D[CMAR 风险型施工经理&lt;br/&gt;设计期即定 GMP]\n  B --&gt;|合并为单一合同| E[设计建造 Design-Build&lt;br/&gt;单一责任主体]\n  B --&gt;|三方共担一份合同| F[IPD 集成项目交付&lt;br/&gt;风险/收益共享池]\n  E --&gt; G[国内对应 EPC 工程总承包]\n  C --&gt; H[低协同 高确定性]\n  D --&gt; I[中协同 GMP 兜底]\n  E --&gt; J[高协同 工期压缩]\n  F --&gt; K[最高协同 共担成败]</pre><p>四种模式在关键维度上的取舍如下表。其中 GMP（Guaranteed Maximum Price，保证最高限价）是 CMAR 与部分 IPD 的核心商务机制——超出限价的部分由承包方自担。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>DBB</th>\n<th>设计建造（DB）</th>\n<th>CMAR</th>\n<th>IPD</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>合同数量（业主侧）</td>\n<td>2 份（设计 + 施工）</td>\n<td>1 份</td>\n<td>2 份（设计 + CM）</td>\n<td>1 份多方协议</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单一责任主体</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>共担，无单一责任方</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>施工方介入时点</td>\n<td>设计 100% 后招标</td>\n<td>项目初期</td>\n<td>设计早期</td>\n<td>立项即介入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>价格机制</td>\n<td>总价/单价竞标</td>\n<td>总价或 GMP</td>\n<td>GMP（30/60/90% 里程碑成本模型）</td>\n<td>目标成本 + 共享池</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超支风险归属</td>\n<td>业主（变更频发）</td>\n<td>设计建造方</td>\n<td>CMAR 自担（超 GMP 部分）</td>\n<td>各方按比例共担</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可叠合施工（fast-track）</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>最强</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>业主对设计的控制力</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>较低</td>\n<td>高（独立设计合同）</td>\n<td>高（全程参与决策）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>来源：<a href=\"https://www.cmaanet.org/sites/default/files/inline-files/owners-guide-to-project-delivery-methods.pdf\">CMAA 业主指南</a>、<a href=\"https://www.procore.com/library/cmar-vs-design-build\">Procore: CMAR vs Design-Build</a>、<a href=\"https://learn.aiacontracts.com/articles/64146-integrated-project-delivery-a-guide/\">AIA Contract Documents</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"dbb-确定性的代价是工期\">DBB：确定性的代价是工期</h2><p>设计-招标-建造（Design-Bid-Build）是历史最久、政府投资项目最常用的模式。它的铁律是：图纸必须 100% 完成后才能拿去招标——招标的全部意义就建立在「设计已冻结」这一前提上（<a href=\"https://www.hourigan.group/resources/insights/construction-delivery-methods-explained/\">Hourigan</a>）。业主分别与设计院、总承包商签两份合同，三方关系如下：设计方对图纸负责，承包商对照图施工负责，业主居中协调。</p>\n<p>它的优点是价格透明、竞标充分、业主对设计细节控制力最强。代价同样明确：设计与施工严格顺序进行，无法叠合，总周期最长；一旦施工阶段发现图纸缺陷或现场冲突，责任界面落在业主身上——承包商会以「按图施工」为由提出变更索赔。设 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{total}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为总工期，DBB 的特征是</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>design</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>bid</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>construction</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{total}} = T_{\\text{design}} + T_{\\text{bid}} + T_{\\text{construction}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">design</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">bid</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">construction</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>三段完全串联。后三种模式都是在想方设法让 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>design</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{design}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">design</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>construction</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{construction}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">construction</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 产生重叠，从而压缩 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{total}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"设计建造与国内-epc-单一责任主体\">设计建造与国内 EPC：单一责任主体</h2><p>设计建造（Design-Build）把设计与施工合并到一份合同下，业主只面对一个责任主体——设计建造方（<a href=\"https://www.procore.com/library/cmar-vs-design-build\">Procore</a>）。这彻底消除了 DBB 里「图纸缺陷算谁的」这种界面争议：设计错了、施工返工，都是同一家公司内部消化。沟通路径短，设计与施工可深度叠合，工期显著压缩，这也是行业数据反复指向「集成型模式在成本与工期上优于顺序型模式」的根本原因（<a href=\"https://www.procore.com/library/construction-project-delivery-methods\">Procore, 2026</a>）。</p>\n<p>它的取舍在于：业主对设计细节的控制力下降——设计服务于「这家公司能高效建造」的目标，业主若中途想大改外观或功能，议价能力弱。</p>\n<p>国内的工程总承包（EPC，Engineering-Procurement-Construction）是设计建造在中文语境下的主要对应物，但范围更宽——它把采购（Procurement）也纳入单一责任链，承包商对设计、采购、施工全过程负责，最终交付「可直接使用的完整项目」，责任主体唯一（<a href=\"https://www.fwxgx.com/articles/244080\">服务新干线</a>）。政策层面，工程总承包已成为强制推行方向：以四川省为例，到 2025 年全省建筑市场符合条件的工程项目普遍采用工程总承包模式（<a href=\"https://www.cnblogs.com/zentaopms/p/18807771\">易软项目平台</a>）。装配式建筑尤其适配 EPC——从方案阶段即按装配式设计，充分考虑构件生产与施工需要，保证设计可行性（<a href=\"http://ojs.omniscient.sg/index.php/MCET/article/download/69498/68040/\">中国二十冶 / MCET 2025</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"cmar-用-gmp-把施工经理锁进设计期\">CMAR：用 GMP 把施工经理锁进设计期</h2><p>风险型施工经理（Construction Manager at Risk）保留了 DBB 的两份独立合同结构——业主仍单独聘请设计方——但额外引入一个施工经理（CM），让他在设计早期就介入，充当「成本与可建性顾问」（<a href=\"https://www.procore.com/library/cmar-construction\">Procore</a>）。关键转折发生在设计推进到某一节点时：CM 给出一个保证最高限价（GMP），从此他的身份从顾问转为「自担风险的总承包商」——超出 GMP 的成本由 CM 自己承担。</p>\n<p>这个 GMP 不是拍脑袋报出来的。CM 在设计 30%、60%、90% 三个里程碑分别建立成本模型，让业主对「项目相对预算跑得如何」有实时可见度（<a href=\"https://www.autodesk.com/blogs/construction/construction-manager-at-risk-cmar-definition-and-best-practices/\">Autodesk</a>、<a href=\"https://www.trimble.com/blog/construction/en-US/article/project-management/project-delivery-methods/construction-manager-at-risk\">Trimble</a>）。CMAR 的成本结构可表达为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>owner</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>actual</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> GMP</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>超支</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>actual</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><mtext>GMP</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> 由 CM 自担</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{owner}} = \\min(C_{\\text{actual}},\\ \\text{GMP}), \\qquad \\text{超支} = \\max(0,\\ C_{\\text{actual}} - \\text{GMP})\\ \\text{由 CM 自担}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">owner</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">actual</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">GMP</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">超支</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">actual</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">GMP</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">由</span><span class=\"mord\"> CM </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">自担</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>CMAR 介于 DBB 与设计建造之间：业主保留对设计的独立控制力（设计合同独立），同时拿到 GMP 兜底、施工可叠合的好处。代价是 CM 早期投入估算的成本会计入项目，且 GMP 谈判本身需要业主有较强的专业判断力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ipd-三方共担一份合同-盈亏绑定\">IPD：三方共担一份合同，盈亏绑定</h2><p>集成项目交付（Integrated Project Delivery）是协同程度最高、也最激进的模式：它用合同强制要求业主、设计方、承包商三个核心方协作，让风险、责任与收益被集体管理、合理分担（<a href=\"https://learn.aiacontracts.com/articles/64146-integrated-project-delivery-a-guide/\">AIA: IPD 完整指南</a>）。三方往往签一份多方协议（Multi-Party Agreement），甚至成立一个专门的有限责任实体（Single Purpose Entity, SPE）来规划、设计、建造项目——SPE 实现了协同流程中风险与收益的完全共享（<a href=\"https://help.aiacontracts.com/hc/en-us/articles/1500010383781-FAQs-Integrated-Project-Delivery-IPD-Family-of-Documents\">AIA FAQ</a>）。</p>\n<p>IPD 的财务发动机是共享风险/收益池（shared risk/reward pool）：各方把利润与「项目整体成功」绑定，建立一个共同的资金池覆盖项目成本与潜在节余；项目若低于预算完工，节余在各方间按事先标定的分配键分摊（<a href=\"https://learn.aiacontracts.com/articles/what-is-an-integrated-project-delivery-contract/\">AIA Contract Documents</a>）。这套机制把传统模式下「我省钱你吃亏」的零和博弈，改造成「一起省钱一起分」的正和博弈。</p>\n<p>AIA 提供三类 IPD 合同形态：过渡型（Transitional Forms，仿照现有施工经理协议，是进入 IPD 的舒适第一步）、多方协议、单一目的实体（SPE）（<a href=\"https://help.aiacontracts.com/hc/en-us/articles/1500010383941-FAQs-Transitional-Forms-Integrated-Project-Delivery-IPD\">AIA FAQ</a>）。代价是显而易见的：IPD 要求极高的信任、成熟的协作文化与 BIM 等数字化协同能力，法律与保险结构也更复杂，因此目前多见于大型、高复杂度、业主有长期合作意愿的项目。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>交付模式的核心是合同拓扑：DBB 分立顺序、设计建造合并、CMAR 分立但早期介入、IPD 三方共担——它决定了风险归属与工期能否叠合。</li>\n<li>DBB 给业主最高的设计控制力与价格透明度，代价是最长的串联工期和易发的变更索赔；适合设计需求明确、求稳的政府投资项目。</li>\n<li>设计建造（及国内更宽口径的 EPC）用单一责任主体消除界面争议、压缩工期，是装配式与工程总承包政策强推的方向；代价是业主对设计细节的控制力下降。</li>\n<li>CMAR 用 GMP 把施工经理在设计期就锁进来，30/60/90% 里程碑成本模型给业主实时可见度，超 GMP 部分由 CM 自担，是「保留设计控制 + 拿到工期与成本好处」的折中。</li>\n<li>IPD 用多方协议和共享收益池把三方盈亏绑定，协同最深、压缩工期最强，但对信任、文化和数字化协同能力要求最高，目前主要用于大型复杂项目。</li>\n<li>没有「最好」的模式，只有「最匹配」的模式——选择取决于项目复杂度、业主专业能力、工期压力与风险偏好；选错的代价可达总造价的 8%–15%。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"项目交付模式（DBB·设计建造·IPD·CMAR）","id":"项目交付模式-dbb-设计建造-ipd-cmar"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：合同关系决定一切","id":"核心概念-合同关系决定一切"},{"level":2,"text":"DBB：确定性的代价是工期","id":"dbb-确定性的代价是工期"},{"level":2,"text":"设计建造与国内 EPC：单一责任主体","id":"设计建造与国内-epc-单一责任主体"},{"level":2,"text":"CMAR：用 GMP 把施工经理锁进设计期","id":"cmar-用-gmp-把施工经理锁进设计期"},{"level":2,"text":"IPD：三方共担一份合同，盈亏绑定","id":"ipd-三方共担一份合同-盈亏绑定"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"建设项目生命周期与利益相关方","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/construction-project-management/fundamentals-delivery/lifecycle-and-stakeholders"},"next":{"title":"范围、WBS 与项目集成管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/construction-project-management/fundamentals-delivery/scope-wbs-integration"}}